        <activityName xml:lang="en">Acetic anhydride from acetaldehyde, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Acetic anhydride from acetaldehyde, at plant
The multioutput-process "acetaldehyde oxidation process" delivers the co-products acetic anhydride from acetyaldehyde and acetic acid from acetaldehyde. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 882a45ff-e247-3c50-b459-5b04b3d10d19
Oxidation acetaldehyde including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Oxidation of acetaldehyde
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_882a45ff-e247-3c50-b459-5b04b3d10d19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
